| 3784663 | `lsh04` | solve, N=256, M=257 (headline mesh) | COMPLETED 0:0, 15m07s |
| 3784910 | `lsh06` | solve, N=256, M=1024: the free rung q=R, the ladder, five POD ranks, six full-order comparators | COMPLETED 0:0, 16m20s |
