   505	**A1.14 Defer order, restated** (first dropped first; each dependency-safe): exploratory A–B–A pairs → the 2D $256^2$
   506	cell → the 3D options with Δt/Δt₀ = 2.5 → the 3D r = 512 rank → common-solver runs of configurations that are not on
   507	the native-solver screening front (the front is decided from native runs plus the common runs already made; a dropped
   508	common run is reported as "not run"). Never dropped: `none` with the native solver at every rank (the HR-error
   509	diagnostic), the ECSW and Q-DEIM grids with the native solver, Stage B, picks, the verdict jobs.
