   511	**A1.15 (item 20) Solvers, comparator naming, spectral.**
   512	- **Native solver = damped Gauss–Newton**: the QR least-squares step with backtracking (step halved up to 8 times
   513	  until $\|\hat r\|$ decreases; if no halving decreases it, exit reason 3), budget 30, previous-state predictor. Its
   514	  convergence sensitivity is reported through the native-vs-common ablation.
