   516	  $0.05\sqrt{\mathrm{mean}_s\|c_s-\bar c\|^2}$ (speed3d trust = 0.05 × the bank's `coefficient_rms_spread`,
   517	  `train2w.py:439–441`), over the training projected coefficients at rank r.
   518	- The un-reduced FOM is named the **full-rank limiting comparator**, not a floor: a reduced model can beat it by error
   519	  cancellation.
   520	- Spectral FOM projection is deferred for scope and cost (a fixed-basis spectral derivative can be precomputed, so it is
   521	  not impossible); it joins the C3-full appendix.
