   530	roundoff). G-fd-c compares with a mixed tolerance: $|\,\|R_Bz\|-\|Bz_{\rm ass}\|\,|\le10^{-10}\,\Sigma$ and
   531	$\|J^\top\hat r-g_{\rm ass}\|\le10^{-10}\,\Sigma\,\|J\|_F$, where $\Sigma = \|\Phi_r(\cdot)\|+\|\Delta t\nu\Delta_h\Phi_r(\cdot)\|+\|U_p(\cdot)\|$
   532	is the sum of the assembled terms' norms (never divided by a vanishing residual or gradient). The cancellation fixture
   533	is frozen: the state reached by 8 Gauss–Newton iterations on the assembled DEIM residual from the random start of the
   534	generic fixture.
