   688	every 5th step $n$: keep the history $(c_n, c_{n-1})$, replace the returned state by $c_{n+1}+\delta_n$ with
   689	$\delta_n = t_n v_1$, $v_1$ the top right singular vector of $J(c_{n+1})$ and $t_n$ such that
   690	$\|J\delta_n\| = 100\,\|\hat r(c_{n+1})\|$ (then $\gamma\approx\sigma_1/\|J\|_F\ge r^{-1/2}\gg10^{-3}$). The certifier
   691	evaluates each tuple **in isolation** (no history propagation). Expected labels come from an independent oracle
   692	(γ recomputed with a `jax.jacfwd` Jacobian): every perturbed tuple non-stationary, every unperturbed tuple unchanged.
   693	Part (b) (wrong-gradient solver) stays reported-only.
