  1089	1e-6 tighter). Round-off is the proposed explanation, not a proven one. Nominal steps (γ ≤ gtol) and allowance steps are
  1090	counted and reported separately for every anchor (`roundoff_stalls` counts the allowance steps). The COMMON-BRIEF Q1
