  1430	after the registered Stage-A grid, by the frozen rule: compute the screening front (Q1-qualified, finite, non-dominated
  1431	in median warm time and worst error on the screening cases); for each front member with κ = 8 add κ = 16 at its rank;
  1432	in 2D, for each front member at r = 384 add r = 512 with its HR kind and knob (κ, or p/r) — both options, both solvers,
