  1508	**A26.6 Staging (code 19 item 8).** The M2 bank (`vendor/quad3d/inputs/model_M2/bank.pkl`) is staged; `stage.py`
  1509	runs `ours.check_assets(cfg)` in the staged tree for the tune driver (every bank, rule, checkpoint and exported error
  1510	the comparators load lazily, with pinned hashes).
